   "date": "2022-11-29",
   "text": "Hide No Harm Act of 2022\n This bill establishes criminal penalties for corporate officers who fail to inform federal agencies, their employees, or affected individuals of any serious physical danger that is associated with their products or services. It also prohibits retaliatory action against whistleblowers."
